  data: {
    LLM: "Go for 31 (Ace-Ten-Face same suit). Or 3 of a kind (30). Don't hold disparate suits. Watch what opponents pick up. If they take a 10 of Hearts, assume they have Hearts.\n\nThe 'Stop' Bluff: Call 'Stop' early with a decent hand (e.g., 20 points) if you think someone else has garbage. It forces them to panic.\n\nDefensive Swapping: Pick up a high card just to deny it to the next player, even if it doesn't help you much (as long as it doesn't ruin your hand).",
    Player: "Go for 31 (Ace-Ten-Face same suit). Or 3 of a kind (30). Don't hold disparate suits. Watch what opponents pick up. If they take a 10 of Hearts, assume they have Hearts.\n\nThe 'Stop' Bluff: Call 'Stop' early with a decent hand (e.g., 20 points) if you think someone else has garbage. It forces them to panic.\n\nDefensive Swapping: Pick up a high card just to deny it to the next player, even if it doesn't help you much (as long as it doesn't ruin your hand).",
